<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2020-11-30a.20.5" speakername="Nadine Dorries" type="Continuation Speech" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/11397" colnum="20" time="17:38:00" url="">
    <p pid="a20.5/1">We will go through the processes that we have been through within the Department of Health and Social Care. They are set in law and abided by during every inquiry; that has included all the past inquiries such as the Dixon inquiry, the Paterson inquiry and the Morecambe Bay inquiry. The same protocols and the same process will be adhered to.</p>
</speech>
